Fix mixed-res-nnedi3-luma naming its nnedi3 passes by their old names

The nnedi3 shaders read the passes before them by alias: jinc2-on-passoutput0
samples nnediPass0 (the YUV conversion) and yuv-to-rgb-2x samples nnediPass3
(the chroma-shifted luma), as the standalone nnedi3 presets declare them:

    alias0 = nnediPass0

The mixed-res presets embed the same shaders at passes 7 and 10, and still
alias those passes the way the shaders used to read them:

    alias7 = "PassOutput0"
    alias10 = "PassOutput3"

Nothing is called nnediPass0 or nnediPass3 in these presets any more, so the
two samplers resolve to nothing: the chroma comes out wrong -- magenta over the
whole picture -- and the luma of pass 11 is flat white.

Renaming the aliases to the names the shaders ask for is the whole fix. The
2x, 3x and 4x presets are identical in this respect.

Reported upstream; this patch is here so the presets are usable meanwhile.

--- a/downsample/mixed-res/2x/mixed-res-nnedi3-luma.slangp
+++ b/downsample/mixed-res/2x/mixed-res-nnedi3-luma.slangp
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
 shader7 = "../../../edge-smoothing/nnedi3/shaders/rgb-to-yuv.slang"
 filter_linear7 = false
 wrap_mode7 = "clamp_to_edge"
-alias7 = "PassOutput0"
+alias7 = "nnediPass0"
 scale_type7 = source
 scale7 = 1.0
 
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
 
 shader10 =  "../../../edge-smoothing/nnedi3/shaders/jinc2-cshift-luma.slang"
 filter_linear10 =  false
-alias10 = "PassOutput3"
+alias10 = "nnediPass3"
 wrap_mode10 =  "clamp_to_edge"
 srgb_framebuffer10 =  "true"
 scale_type10 =  source
--- a/downsample/mixed-res/3x/mixed-res-nnedi3-luma.slangp
+++ b/downsample/mixed-res/3x/mixed-res-nnedi3-luma.slangp
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
 shader7 = "../../../edge-smoothing/nnedi3/shaders/rgb-to-yuv.slang"
 filter_linear7 = false
 wrap_mode7 = "clamp_to_edge"
-alias7 = "PassOutput0"
+alias7 = "nnediPass0"
 scale_type7 = source
 scale7 = 1.0
 
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
 
 shader10 =  "../../../edge-smoothing/nnedi3/shaders/jinc2-cshift-luma.slang"
 filter_linear10 =  false
-alias10 = "PassOutput3"
+alias10 = "nnediPass3"
 wrap_mode10 =  "clamp_to_edge"
 srgb_framebuffer10 =  "true"
 scale_type10 =  source
--- a/downsample/mixed-res/4x/mixed-res-nnedi3-luma.slangp
+++ b/downsample/mixed-res/4x/mixed-res-nnedi3-luma.slangp
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@
 shader7 = "../../../edge-smoothing/nnedi3/shaders/rgb-to-yuv.slang"
 filter_linear7 = false
 wrap_mode7 = "clamp_to_edge"
-alias7 = "PassOutput0"
+alias7 = "nnediPass0"
 scale_type7 = source
